# Norden UI's and Edge UI's permissions forbid redistributing their art outside Nexus:
# every file that carries it stays on the build machine.
Interface/
SKSE/
MapMarkers/
# ...except the recoloured output this project produces, which the repository owner keeps here
# alongside the source mods he committed to main. See NOTICE.md - Nexus permissions still apply.
!Norden UI - Edge Colours/**
build/
package/*.zip
*.swf
*.svg
*.bin
*.7z
__pycache__/
*.pyc
